### ─── 게시글 (관리자) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### @RequestMapping("/adm/board/{bbsMasterId}/article")
### ⚠ 사용자 경로와 <b>같은 서비스 메서드</b>(BoardArticleService#save)를 부른다.
###   달라지는 것은 인가 체인·사이트 해석·뷰 해석뿐이다.

### 8. 게시글 목록 — GET /adm/board/{bbsMasterId}/article
GET {{baseUrl}}/adm/board/{{sampleBbsMasterId}}/article
Accept: text/html

> {%
    client.test("목록 응답", function () {
        client.assert([200, 302].includes(response.status),
            "예상 밖 status=" + response.status);
    });
    const m = String(response.body).match(/name="_csrf"\s+value="([^"]+)"/);
    if (m) { client.global.set("csrfAdmin", m[1]); }
%}

### 9. 게시글 등록 폼 — GET /adm/board/{bbsMasterId}/article/form
### 이 화면이 열릴 때 articleId(BBA_…)가 미리 발급된다 — 첨부 picker 가 저장 전에 쓴다.
GET {{baseUrl}}/adm/board/{{sampleBbsMasterId}}/article/form
Accept: text/html

> {%
    client.test("폼 응답", function () {
        client.assert([200, 302].includes(response.status),
            "예상 밖 status=" + response.status);
    });
    const body = String(response.body);
    const a = body.match(/BBA_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}/);
    if (a) {
        client.global.set("preIssuedArticleId", a[0]);
        client.log("선발급 articleId = " + a[0]);
    }
    const c = body.match(/name="_csrf"\s+value="([^"]+)"/);
    if (c) { client.global.set("csrfAdmin", c[1]); }
%}

### 10. 게시글 저장(관리자) — POST /adm/board/{bbsMasterId}/article/save
### @ModelAttribute BbsArticleAdmDto
### 검증(BoardArticleServiceImpl.validate):
###   title    필수
###   content  필수
###   noticeYn=Y 는 ROLE_STAFF 이상만 (관리자는 통과)
###   YOUTUBE 게시판이면 linkUrl 필수
### 서버가 덮어쓰는 필드: bbsMasterId · writerUserId · writerUserType · clientIp · status
### attachments = 파일 ID CSV (10-file.http 로 업로드한 뒤 채운다)
POST {{baseUrl}}/adm/board/{{sampleBbsMasterId}}/article/save
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfAdmin}}

articleId={{preIssuedArticleId}}&title=%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%20%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%EA%B2%8C%EC%8B%9C%EA%B8%80&content=%3Cp%3EIntelliJ%20HTTP%20Client%20%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D%20%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%EB%B3%B8%EB%AC%B8%EC%9E%85%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4.%3C%2Fp%3E&noticeYn=Y&secretYn=N

> {%
    client.test("저장 처리", function () {
        client.assert([200, 302].includes(response.status),
            "예상 밖 status=" + response.status);
    });
    if (response.status === 302) {
        client.global.set("sampleArticleId", client.global.get("preIssuedArticleId"));
        client.log("sampleArticleId = " + client.global.get("preIssuedArticleId"));
    }
%}

